Kosmos is ELF (docs/w4.md W4d). WTF's inline-assembly helpers name the
systems whose objects are ELF and whose assembler speaks GNU syntax, and
JavaScriptCore's interpreter, written as one large asm statement, uses
them for its labels: a local label is .Lname, a hidden symbol .hidden.
Kosmos's images are ELF, assembled by clang's integrated assembler.

--- a/Source/WTF/wtf/InlineASM.h
+++ b/Source/WTF/wtf/InlineASM.h
